<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ doc_label }} {{ doc_no }}</title>
<style>
/* ===========================================================================
   云枢 ERP 盘点单模板（PDF-04：盘点表格式）
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   ★ 本模板是**唯一**需要空白栏的单据：打印出来拿去仓库现场盘点，
     「实盘数量」「差异」「备注」三栏一律留空，由盘点人手写。
     —— 所以这三列**不填任何系统值**（哪怕单据里已经有实盘数），
        只在表下用「填表说明」写清口径。

   结构：页眉 → 单据头（单号 / 盘点日期 / 仓库 / 盘点类型 / 状态 / 经办人）
        → 明细（账面数量 + 三列空白手写栏）→ 合计 → 填表说明 → 签字栏 → 页脚。

   打印四条铁律（与订单 / 出入库模板同源）：
     ① @page 定死纸张与外边距；
     ② thead { display: table-header-group } —— 明细跨页时表头重复（盘点单动辄几十行）；
     ③ tr / .sign / .summary / .hint { break-inside: avoid } —— 不腰斩；
     ④ .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums } —— 账面数量等宽右对齐。

   页码由 CDP footerTemplate 输出（`pdf::template::stock_take_footer`）。
   =========================================================================== */
@page {
  size: A4 portrait;
  margin: 12mm 10mm 16mm 10mm;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: "Noto Sans SC", "Noto Sans CJK SC", sans-serif;
  font-size: 10pt;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: #1f2329;
  word-break: break-word;
}

/* ---------- 页眉 ---------- */
.sheet-header {
  border-bottom: 1.5pt solid #1f2329;
  padding-bottom: 4pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
}
.sheet-header .company {
  font-size: 12.5pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 1pt;
}
.sheet-header .doc-title {
  font-size: 17pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  letter-spacing: 8pt;
  margin: 4pt 0 6pt;
}

/* ---------- 单据头 ---------- */
table.head-fields {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
}
table.head-fields td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #c9cdd4;
  padding: 3pt 5pt;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
table.head-fields td.label {
  width: 62pt;
  background: #f2f3f5;
  color: #4e5969;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
table.head-fields td.value { width: auto; }

/* ---------- 明细表 ---------- */
table.detail {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9pt;
}
table.detail thead { display: table-header-group; }
table.detail th,
table.detail td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #86909c;
  padding: 2.4pt 3.5pt;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
table.detail th {
  background: #f2f3f5;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
table.detail tr { break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid; }
table.detail td.c-seq { text-align: center; width: 22pt; }
table.detail td.c-code { width: 76pt; white-space: nowrap; }
table.detail td.c-name { width: auto; }
/* 规格 66pt：56pt 会把 DN100/PN16 折行（145 实测），盘点表逐行核规格时最忌讳折行 */
table.detail td.c-spec { width: 66pt; }
table.detail td.c-unit { text-align: center; width: 26pt; }
table.detail td.c-loc { width: 48pt; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
table.detail td.c-book { width: 48pt; }
/* ★ 三列手写栏：加高（22pt）让现场笔迹写得下；内容恒为空 */
table.detail th.w-actual,
table.detail th.w-diff,
table.detail th.w-note { background: #fff7e8; }
table.detail td.w-actual { width: 64pt; height: 22pt; }
table.detail td.w-diff { width: 56pt; height: 22pt; }
table.detail td.w-note { width: auto; height: 22pt; }
table.detail td.c-code,
table.detail td.c-name,
table.detail td.c-spec { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

.num {
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  font-feature-settings: "tnum" 1;
  text-align: right;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* ---------- 合计区（整块不跨页） ---------- */
.summary {
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
  margin-top: 8pt;
}
.summary table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
}
.summary table td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #86909c;
  padding: 3pt 5pt;
}
.summary .label {
  width: 84pt;
  text-align: center;
  background: #f2f3f5;
  font-weight: 700;
}

/* ---------- 填表说明 ---------- */
.hint {
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
  margin-top: 9pt;
  border: 0.8pt dashed #86909c;
  padding: 5pt 8pt;
  font-size: 8.8pt;
  color: #4e5969;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
.hint .title { font-weight: 700; color: #1f2329; }

/* ---------- 签字栏 ---------- */
.sign {
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
  margin-top: 12pt;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 8pt;
  font-size: 9pt;
}
.sign .box { flex: 1 1 0; }
.sign .cap { color: #4e5969; white-space: nowrap; }
.sign .line { margin-top: 16pt; border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #4e5969; height: 1pt; }
.sign .date { margin-top: 3pt; color: #86909c; font-size: 8.5pt; }

.remark {
  margin-top: 9pt;
  font-size: 8.8pt;
  color: #4e5969;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.remark .tag { font-weight: 700; color: #1f2329; }

.footnote {
  margin-top: 5pt;
  font-size: 7.5pt;
  color: #86909c;
  text-align: right;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="sheet-header">
  <div class="company">{{ company }}</div>
  <div class="doc-title">{{ doc_title }}</div>
</div>

<table class="head-fields">
{% for row in meta_rows %}
  <tr>
{% for field in row %}
    <td class="label">{{ field.label }}</td>
    <td class="value">{{ field.value }}</td>
{% endfor %}
  </tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>

<table class="detail">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>#</th>
      <th>物料编码</th>
      <th>物料名称</th>
      <th>规格</th>
      <th>单位</th>
      <th>库位</th>
      <th>账面数量</th>
      <th class="w-actual">实盘数量</th>
      <th class="w-diff">差异</th>
      <th class="w-note">备注</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
{% for item in items %}
    <tr>
      <td class="c-seq">{{ item.seq }}</td>
      <td class="c-code">{{ item.material_code }}</td>
      <td class="c-name">{{ item.material_name }}</td>
      <td class="c-spec">{{ item.spec }}</td>
      <td class="c-unit">{{ item.unit }}</td>
      <td class="c-loc">{{ item.location }}</td>
      <td class="c-book num">{{ item.book_qty }}</td>
      <td class="w-actual blank"></td>
      <td class="w-diff blank"></td>
      <td class="w-note blank"></td>
    </tr>
{% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="summary">
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td class="label">行数合计</td>
      <td class="num" style="width:56pt">{{ row_count }}</td>
      <td class="label">账面数量合计</td>
      <td class="num" style="width:96pt">{{ total_book_qty }}</td>
      <td class="label">盘点类型</td>
      <td style="width:96pt;text-align:center">{{ take_type }}</td>
    </tr>
{% if show_diff %}
    <tr>
      <td class="label">盘盈数量合计</td>
      <td class="num">{{ total_gain_qty }}</td>
      <td class="label">盘亏数量合计</td>
      <td class="num">{{ total_loss_qty }}</td>
      <td class="label">差异金额合计（{{ currency }}）</td>
      <td class="num">{{ total_diff_amount }}</td>
    </tr>
{% endif %}
  </table>
</div>

<div class="hint">
  <div class="title">填表说明</div>
  <div>1）{{ blank_hint }}</div>
  <div>2）差异 = 实盘数量 − 账面数量（盘盈记正数，盘亏记负数），由复核人逐行复算。</div>
  <div>3）本表「账面数量」是建单时点的账面快照，仅供现场比对；盘盈盘亏一律以系统过账后的凭证为准。</div>
</div>

{% if remark %}
<div class="remark"><span class="tag">盘点范围／备注：</span>{{ remark }}</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="sign">
{% for cap in sign_caps %}
  <div class="box">
    <div class="cap">{{ cap }}</div>
    <div class="line"></div>
    <div class="date">日期：__________</div>
  </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="footnote">打印时间：{{ printed_at }}　本单据由云枢系统生成（{{ engine }}）</div>
</body>
</html>
